# Visual identity

Indoor padel night. Not Inter / cream / terracotta / default shadcn.

Tokens (keep names): `--ink #07131f`, `--turf #0c4a86`, `--court #1473c4`, `--ball #d4f34a`, `--wall` cool blue-gray, `--ticket` ice white. Fonts already in `layout.tsx`: **Syne** display, **Figtree** body, **IBM Plex Mono** stubs. Do not add Inter.

Chrome: dark ink header + footer, lime wordmark/CTA. Mobile-first: no cramped wrap; deal book CTA sticky on small screens. Laptop: club table readable (`min-w` + horizontal scroll).

Tickets (TGTG): left time stub, dashed perforation, notched corners (`.ticket`), lime `−{n}%` sticker, struck original price, deal price in Syne, offset ink shadow. Restyle markup; do not change price/discount math (`formatEuro`, `discountPercent`).

Forms: square (`rounded-none`), taller inputs (`h-11`), ink border, lime/turf focus. Buttons: lime fill + ink type, or ink fill + lime type. No pill radius.

States that must look designed, not blank: empty deals, expired slot (`startsAt` past), taken/held slot, checkout cancelled, booking error query, 404, `error.tsx`. Copy stays English and concrete (“Someone else just took this slot.”).

Business rules while restyling: do not change auth, queries, slot create/cancel/approve, or seed data. Demo login buttons must remain on `/login`.
